<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux Q1 97 current account surplus widens.</title>
<headline>Belgolux Q1 97 current account surplus widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>						   Q1 97	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>    CURRENT ACCOUNT			 126	     118</p>
<p>    -- Goods				   82		81</p>
<p>    -- Services				39		29</p>
<p>    -- Receipts				49		47</p>
<p>    -- Current transfers		  -44	     -38</p>
<p>    Direct investments		    -39		64</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures given on a cash basis (transactions are recorded when money is paid, as opposed to when goods pass frontier).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
